# No Skip-to-Content Links

Do not add "Skip to content", "Skip to main content", or any `skip-to-content` / skip-nav link or component.

- Do not create or restore `SkipToContent` components.
- Do not add `className="skip-to-content"` or equivalent CSS.
- Do not add `#main-content` / `#dashboard-main` anchors solely for skip links.
